  "html": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>优秀作品示例</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">精选平台上线的优质车机主题，供开发者参考学习。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/668c5c82454c4b98ab469b7aa1358a69.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-8107ddde57d449e0afa3600b369021fc-0-dadcd4e213019e53d3ce425913af50711a6fa600ed38c32a634690e5e45db548\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/48c697af8b5a46ba92585fd015a045ec.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-df62036b700a49a4b490580f7ae28a43-0-16653ea80fb989f9b7ac9b2c6dc4a0839e2d20fd3712e669d55c679c75ff3e41\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：Honey</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 玫瑰星球</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：玫瑰坠入星河，你落在我心上</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：随机播放，含昼夜模式。双击切换不同星球状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1bd6956b06024f46b239873ca3ad8353.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-10b25dbc28c6420283dc0358d0a9e9cc-0-5350f3ca8ab9a57888dd8529c7c3ce1c3d911743546ef58b2b2ba127825c6461\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e87adc86f5dc4dfa8ac311b93d6db475.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-0e175fd54ae14be8b23caaefc31b9f65-0-be3b174d5332a547f2a699713817686916555d802bc1f58ab4252ed422455665\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：Rui睿睿</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 原点</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：被遗忘在宇宙尽头的角落，一束光落在肩上，独自前行，也是探索的起点</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：顺序播放+过渡动画，双击切换多种状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a4f3932acac2407f91cc950ee173d4fd.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-9d8194974c9a4e0eafcfbc0fbff2b77a-0-b99904794a5949a929303edfa30a0b669a1a013df1ad15c9d3aaa05d2ba60e16\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/460852b1f5c04f9bb753b2f478f35db5.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-7cd172645f144befb44337bab484ca92-0-d6e5ff4c6bf109a161a1ace715bd12f17024d22817fb6ef6ab5cc61642f82665\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：沙丁酱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 云栖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：松松软软的泡沫云朵，堆叠在蓝天的画布上。昼夜两种色彩，双击切换萌趣状态。放松，从看到云朵的那刻开始</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：顺序播放+过渡动画，含昼夜模式。双击切换萌趣状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/dc06d88f4c5f4ea6b14a74222e758bb0.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-9d5b680e87934dd2b4b62658814d9eed-0-4e423b96001205e5a0d434bafe50b64ef9c6d6b05c7754e5487588c45ac0a70f\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/2f70be5b6c0d4855aa6a1275df84bcfc.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-30af294dbf4a426ba8c4cbb345bb4fd2-0-abe3282bfe182194225dcbd418d6f6dbe1091894b99682ce99622c4b6b01646c\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：YOMeeDoll有咪兜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 小企鹅兜兜-宠鹅海岛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：小企鹅兜兜躺平泡汤、远航垂钓、沉浸式海岛下午茶，双击解锁兜兜的松弛假日吧。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：主场景串联，双击企鹅岛上5处带有小企鹅兜兜的画面区域，即可解锁对应动态场景，再次双击即可返回主岛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9fe93173bda9456a914a1f17a29e81ed.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-fb89113fd4d841938ff2f0a956f07535-0-109850a404556735229158c9619fe45f51983852f29a34afd399eb4a5c4f2e57\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/fd147517112546f0adec0d5151592918.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-66c4700a19da435882e63524ed2713ff-0-d8b40390ae5b20a567e4769571c51e311d3ab680ee139e9088becb5cc90611ec\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：YOMeeDoll有咪兜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 小企鹅兜兜-露营日记</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：和企鹅兜兜一起露营，让生活慢下来。双击屏幕，换种野法</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：主场景串联，</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">含昼夜模式。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">双击左中右热区切换不同场景</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/67e09513abf74cfbb2f89a25a2e48fa8.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-5454a302278c4f00887a8a5aefe11fc9-0-c63c6f1747bd03110e51e59f64bf9ddae8d6193eee8b56eaad8618dbe25d0700\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/51686a71f3864d5cb2778ce949f3f0ed.mp4?auth_key=1795677198-aee24676bd6f47c18f3990f6e3b755d6-0-204a70450ce2378fd865350d8a87bef557370adea37f9836e22e9c28474679a4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：夏语猫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;疯癫杀马特</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：视觉冲击力极强的灵魂爆炸头小猫，五种疯癫状态随机切换，专治各种无聊。双击，解锁下一个疯癫瞬间</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：随机播放+过渡动画，双击切换不同疯癫状态</span></p>"
}
